{#
    Requesting the balance (Step 10b.4), in the style of the quote email:
    "Dear {first name},", the opening, the studio's personal note (if any,
    its own paragraph, as the quote email's note), the signature (every
    balance request, by the voice rules, 15 October 2026), "01 Balance" (the
    order number, the order total, what was paid and the balance), "Pay
    balance" (the quote page) straight under it, "02 Your order" (the lamps,
    size and quantity) and "View your order" (layout and wording from the
    wording pass 11.5, 16 October 2026). Sent from admin
    ("Request balance"). Laid out by email/_customer.html.twig (the email
    rules of Step 11.0).
#}
{% extends 'email/_customer.html.twig' %}
{% import 'email/_customer.html.twig' as layout %}
{% macro money(pence) %}{{ (pence / 100)|format_currency('GBP', {fraction_digit: pence % 100 == 0 ? 0 : 2}) }}{% endmacro %}
{% import _self as m %}

{% block title %}Your Lumen Forma balance, {{ firstName ?? order.designRequest.fullName }}{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}The balance of {{ m.money(order.amountOwed) }} for your Lumen Forma order {{ order.orderNumber }} is ready to pay.{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
{# Only the order number shown (14 October 2026). #}
<p style="{{ body }}" data-email-opening>The balance of {{ m.money(order.amountOwed) }} for your Lumen Forma order {{ order.orderNumber }} is now ready to pay. You can pay it securely with the button below.</p>
{% if note %}<p style="{{ body }}" data-email-note data-balance-note>{{ note|nl2br }}</p>{% endif %}
{{ include('email/_signature.html.twig') }}
{{ layout.section('01', 'Balance') }}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
    <tr><td width="60%" style="{{ keyStyle }}">Order number</td><td style="{{ valueStyle }}">{{ order.orderNumber }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td width="60%" style="{{ keyStyle }}">Order total</td><td style="{{ valueStyle }}">{{ m.money(order.total) }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td width="60%" style="{{ keyStyle }}">Paid {{ order.paidAt|date('j F Y', 'Europe/London') }}</td><td style="{{ valueStyle }}">{{ m.money(order.amountPaid) }}</td></tr>
    <tr><td width="60%" style="{{ strongKey }}">Balance to pay</td><td style="{{ strongValue }}">{{ m.money(order.amountOwed) }}</td></tr>
</table>
<div style="height:32px;line-height:32px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</div>
{{ layout.button(url('quote_show', { token: token }), 'Pay balance · ' ~ m.money(order.amountOwed)) }}
{{ layout.section('02', 'Your order') }}
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" data-balance-lamps>
    {% for item in order.items|filter(i => not i.extra) %}
        <tr><td style="{{ keyStyle }}">Lumen Forma {{ item.sizeName }}{% if item.quantity > 1 %} × {{ item.quantity }}{% endif %}</td></tr>
    {% endfor %}
</table>
<div style="height:32px;line-height:32px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</div>
{{ layout.button(url('order_view', { token: order.viewToken }), 'View your order') }}
<div style="height:24px;line-height:24px;font-size:1px;">&nbsp;</div>
<p style="{{ body }}">Reply to this email with any questions.</p>
{% endblock %}
